{%- comment -%}
  Shop money_format is "Rs. {{amount}}", so the money filter cannot be used.
  Server-renders a plain rupee figure; pl-cart-b.js upgrades it to Indian
  digit grouping. Without JS the number is still correct, just ungrouped.
{%- endcomment -%}
<span data-plb-inr="{{ p }}">&#8377;{{ p | divided_by: 100 }}</span>
